WEBVTT

12:32.028 --> 12:33.654
I know I broke my oath.

12:34.864 --> 12:36.365
And I know I'm a deserter.

12:37.241 --> 12:39.910
I should have gone back to the Wall
and warned them, but...

12:41.078 --> 12:43.080
I saw what I saw.

12:43.205 --> 12:44.749
I saw the white walkers.

12:46.709 --> 12:48.544
People need to know.

12:50.713 --> 12:52.548
If you can get word to my family...

12:52.673 --> 12:54.967
tell them I'm no coward.

12:55.092 --> 12:57.053
Tell them I'm sorry.
